   "textDisplay": "📌 You asked, so here are my honest answers 👇\n\n“Do you get paid?” Yes, this is my job. After 35 years in the beauty industry, sharing what I’ve learned is now my business. Affiliate links and the occasional brand partnership are how I keep making free videos for you. When something is sponsored, I’ll always tell you, and I only share what I actually use.\n\n“What happened to the product you loved before?” Nothing! I still love RMS, Jones Road and everything else I’ve shown you. I test a lot of products so you don’t have to. If I used the same one in every video, it wouldn’t be much of a channel. I give you options, and you pick what’s right for you. You only need one.\n\n“Isn’t a brightener just concealer?” Concealer covers and sits on top. A brightener is sheer and uses light, so it moves with your skin as we age. To the makeup artists here: your technique is your technique, and mine is mine. We’re all different, and that’s what makes the world go around.\n\n“What about bags?” I hear you! Bags are a different problem from dark circles, and a video on them is coming soon.\n\nAre your dark circles light, medium or dark? I read and answer every comment 💛. Thank you all for your support!  xo Kim",
