   "textDisplay": "I ve had dark circles my whole life, as a pragmatic german, asked a dermatologisch and heard its nothing but too thin Skin, and the  advice * just cover it*...i took concealer which became more liquid over the years.  Then came the colour correction staff...it imoroved a little bit, not connected to how pricy ot was. My game changer was - i was already over 60! - CATRICE eye brightener, i only bought it because it was the only under- eye- product i could get in that store at all (traveling).\nIt was the game changer...i have very light Skin and use it even without make up.And CATRICE is really affordable ( 3!€)....i was so frightened they might take it off  market, i always have at least 4 in store 😂.if i use make up ( preferable Loreal AGE Perfect)i tap their liquid concealer over the brightener....and its even better...",
